{"lesson":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7vbasbir","courseId":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","order":52,"title":"Wie viel Mehl?","nativeTitle":"How Much Flour?","focus":"","level":"","fromLang":"English","toLang":"German","targetLanguage":"de-DE","nativeLanguage":"en-US","speakers":["Inge","Nico","Tarek"],"speakerGenders":{"Inge":"female","Nico":"male","Tarek":"male"},"sentences":[{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ja! Das sieht gut aus. Diesmal schaffen wir das. So schwer ist Kochen doch nicht.","native":"Yes! That looks good. This time we'll manage it. Cooking isn't that hard, after all."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Zwiebeln schneiden … Das mache ich. Du schneidest den Fetakäse in kleine Stücke.","native":"Cutting onions … I'll do that. You cut the feta cheese into small pieces."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Alles?","native":"All of it?"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ja, wir brauchen 250 Gramm. Danach schneidest du die Tomaten und den Schinken klein .","native":"Yes, we need 250 grams. After that you chop the tomatoes and the ham."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Und zum Schluss legst du alles auf den Pizzateig. Schau mal. Hier im Kochbuch steht : Schneiden Sie zuerst den Käse klein, schneiden Sie dann die Tomaten und den Schinken in Würfel , legen Sie alles auf die Pizza und schieben Sie die Pizza für 20 Minuten bei 180 Grad in den Ofen .","native":"And finally you put everything on the pizza dough. Look. Here in the cookbook it says: First chop the cheese, then cut the tomatoes and the ham into cubes, put everything on the pizza and slide the pizza into the oven for 20 minutes at 180 degrees."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Okay.","native":"Okay."},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Meine Schwester kann sehr gut kochen und backen . Ich leider nicht.","native":"My sister can cook and bake very well. Unfortunately I can't."},{"speaker":"Nico","target":"Ich auch nicht. Aber Pizzabacken ist leicht !","native":"Me neither. But baking pizza is easy!"},{"speaker":"Inge","target":"Ja.","native":"Yes."},{"speaker":"Tarek","target":"Guten Appetit.","native":"Enjoy your meal."}],"teach":null,"wordData":null,"progress":{"teach":false,"full":false,"practice":null},"createdAt":1795063529495,"updatedAt":1795063529521},"course":{"id":"dl_mwn2h7w0a4ehr","name":"Nicos Weg","level":"","from":"","to":"German","createdAt":1795063529520,"custom":true},"pack":{"v":1,"lines":{"0":{"f":"Ja! Das sieht gut aus. Diesmal schaffen wir das. So schwer ist Kochen doch nicht.","fn":"Yes! That looks good. This time we'll manage it. Cooking isn't that hard, after all."},"1":{"f":"Zwiebeln schneiden … Das mache ich. Du schneidest den Fetakäse in kleine Stücke.","fn":"Cutting onions … I'll do that. You cut the feta cheese into small pieces."},"2":{"f":"Alles?","fn":"All of it?"},"3":{"f":"Ja, wir brauchen 250 Gramm. Danach schneidest du die Tomaten und den Schinken klein .","fn":"Yes, we need 250 grams. After that you chop the tomatoes and the ham."},"4":{"f":"Und zum Schluss legst du alles auf den Pizzateig. Schau mal. Hier im Kochbuch steht : Schneiden Sie zuerst den Käse klein, schneiden Sie dann die Tomaten und den Schinken in Würfel , legen Sie alles auf die Pizza und schieben Sie die Pizza für 20 Minuten bei 180 Grad in den Ofen .","fn":"And finally you put everything on the pizza dough. Look. Here in the cookbook it says: First chop the cheese, then cut the tomatoes and the ham into cubes, put everything on the pizza and slide the pizza into the oven for 20 minutes at 180 degrees."},"5":{"f":"Okay.","fn":"Okay."},"6":{"f":"Meine Schwester kann sehr gut kochen und backen . Ich leider nicht.","fn":"My sister can cook and bake very well. Unfortunately I can't."},"7":{"f":"Ich auch nicht. Aber Pizzabacken ist leicht !","fn":"Me neither. But baking pizza is easy!"},"8":{"f":"Ja.","fn":"Yes."},"9":{"f":"Guten Appetit.","fn":"Enjoy your meal."}},"xt":{},"words":[{"lang":"de-de","word":"gut","engine":"edge","voice":"de-DE-ConradNeural","dataUrl":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"},{"lang":"de-de","word":"Ich","engin